        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hundred Youkai Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tactical command RPG featuring over 100 yokai.</strong><br><strong>Form your ultimate Hyakki Yagyō, master deep strategy, and conquer deadly encounters!</strong><br>Challenge yourself in a battle-focused, high-difficulty RPG—no exploration, just pure tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for players seeking high-difficulty and challenging battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A powerless onmyoji leads a hundred yokai into battle—</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hyakuyoushi&quot;</i> is a command-based strategy RPG with a deep tactical core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Sei</strong>, a young onmyoji who has lost her spiritual power, and the twin nine-tailed foxes <strong>Kuro</strong> and <strong>Shiro</strong>, as they embark on a journey to reclaim her lost arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/9f43d52f53a8fca1c06895d7641a11dc.avif?t=1779977624\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl without onmyō arts—Haru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without pacts nor mystical talent,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she faced the youkai simply as a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind her carefree smile lies a will stronger than any spell.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with a hundred allies at her side,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the false onmyōji tears through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/90133bf359562cbfcba65cb8a2eb4e07.avif?t=1779977624\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dōman, the archenemy who cursed Haru’s master to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius of orthodox onmyō arts,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he tramples youkai with elegance and cruelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, battle is beauty—and mockery, his art.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Haru, this &quot;embodiment of curses&quot; stands as the ultimate wall she must break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 yokai from a pool of 100, each with their own attributes, skills, and combo techniques, to form your ultimate party.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All yokai can grow strong with proper training—build your own unbeatable Hyakki Yagyō!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is turn-based and highly strategic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges on skill order, buffs/debuffs, formation choices, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no exploration or mini-games, this title focuses entirely on combat, delivering a fast-paced and concentrated tactical experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・100 yokai to recruit and battle with!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　A limitless variety of team compositions and strategies based on skills, elements, and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/f60d7ded7e9a3c85b245a048071549b6.avif?t=1779977624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras_big/f60d7ded7e9a3c85b245a048071549b6.avif?t=1779977624 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Deep, strategic command-based combat  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Skill sequencing, formation tactics, and buff/debuff timing all matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Permanent growth system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Monsters gain strength through battle and fusing duplicates (Yōryoku Unleashing).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Equip powerful gear to your favorite yokai to bring out their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Temporary growth mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Relics and Yokai Seals grant temporary boosts within quests. Use them wisely for speed runs and high-level tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Multiple playstyles supported  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Whether you prefer brute strength through training or efficient runs via tactical buffs—the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Combat System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Turn-based command battle (no grid movement)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Each yokai has multiple unique skills  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Skills consume cost points—plan your turns and resource usage carefully  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Combining skill order, buffs, and combo attacks changes the tide of battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/5246cc5d49307dc4cac344fef48474c6.avif?t=1779977624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras_big/5246cc5d49307dc4cac344fef48474c6.avif?t=1779977624 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Game Details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Playable yokai: 100    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Save system: Manual and auto-save supported  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Languages: Japanese / English / Simplified Chinese  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Mode: Single-player only / Full controller support  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Difficulty: No difficulty setting (stages increase in challenge over time)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1779977624\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Recommended For Players Who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Enjoy character growth and tactical depth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Want to raise 